	(text "Daughter-card stack (docs/requirements.md 4.5, tools/stack_bus.py). The core is the TOP of the stack:\nJ10/J11 are pin headers on its underside, plugged into the top card's Samtec ESQ stacking sockets.\nUnderside mounting mirrors the pad columns: pad k = bus pin k+1 (k odd) / k-1 (stack_bus.underside).\nJ10 is LOGIC only. J11 (opposite board edge) carries RACK +12V / GND_RACK for relays and CAN1 bus power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f71cd4de-529b-4d86-8cea-48242c971cad")
